"Cannot change %(field)s on %(asset)s: filed (frozen) tax-depreciation years "
"exist and the change would silently contradict them. Use the Backfill "
"(migration) wizard to correct the tax parameters — it unfreezes and rebuilds "
"the history explicitly."
